,"occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T18:14:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033787","verified_at":"2026-10-22T22:44:34Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4959600-1847286114032702","game_id":"steam-4959600","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update v0.2.3: Difficulty Options and Tips for Your First Runs","summary":"Hi everyone! We've been watching your playthroughs and noticed that it's easy to miss a few important things on your first runs: creating a synergy, installing a ram, or spotting a bomber in time. This update helps you learn the ropes and find a challenge that suits you. Choose your difficultyYou can now choose from three difficulty settings before starting a new expedition: Easy - fewer enemies attacking at once and reduced incoming damage, giving you room to learn and try different crew combin","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:43:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114032702","verified_at":"2026-10-22T17:21:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4959600-1847286114031390","game_id":"steam-4959600","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo v0.2.2: changelog","summary":"\\Starting soldier: a new game lets you pick 1 of 3 base classes (Automatic gunner / Machinist / Frost alchemist). The soldier joins the locomotive crew slot for free on L1; the choice is kept when you restart the run.Synergy reactions: 10 reactions between elements of two different active synergies (fire, frost, electricity, poison, shrapnel). They play out in two phases - charge → payoff; reaction chains are capped to prevent endless cascades.In-combat promotion: a soldier’s model changes the m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T06:21:42Z","time_prec